"'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz'\n"
">>> m2.tolist()\n"
"[97, 98, 99, 100, 101, 102, 103, ... 121, 122]\n"
">>>"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.7.rst:643
msgid ""
":class:`memoryview` objects allow modifying the underlying object if it's a "
